<p>Tighten the ethereal leash to some of your minions currently within your aura of undeath, pulling them to you and swapping place with any eventual foes in the way.</p><p>Up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> minions are affected.</p><p>When recalling a minion the spell tries to prioritize a spot where there is already a foe, to push it away.</p>